      <guid>https://lcolladotor.github.io/publication/2026_07_fentanyl_rat_hb_amy/</guid>
      <description>&lt;blockquote class=&#34;bluesky-embed&#34; data-bluesky-uri=&#34;at://did:plc:ov45ekuxlvq4se3ltfkf2den/app.bsky.feed.post/3mruonpfjgc2z&#34; data-bluesky-cid=&#34;bafyreihi3cyfrucadkqvdv7nzpr6iflep5s5q7stdxss2dxk7ah44piq7i&#34; data-bluesky-embed-color-mode=&#34;system&#34;&gt;&lt;p lang=&#34;en&#34;&gt;🧠🧬 What are the effects of intravenous fentanyl self-administration on the habenula and amygdala transcriptomes?
